  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "cell_0",
      "order": 0,
      "label": "Introduction",
      "cell_type": "Markdown",
      "source": "> *AI authored to showcase ironpad capabilities.*\n\n# Fractal Tree 🌳\n\nA **fractal tree** is a self-similar structure generated by repeatedly applying a simple branching rule: each branch splits into two smaller branches at a fixed angle, and each new branch is a fixed ratio shorter than its parent.\n\n## Self-Similarity\n\nThe tree is self-similar at every scale — zoom into any subtree and it looks like the whole tree. This is the hallmark of a fractal. Formally, the tree is the fixed point of the **iterated function system** (IFS):\n\n$$T = \\bigcup_{i=1}^{2} f_i(T)$$\n\nwhere each $f_i$ is a contracting similarity (rotation + scaling).\n\n## Recursive Structure\n\nThe depth-$n$ tree satisfies:\n\n$$\\text{Tree}(n, \\ell, \\theta) = \\text{branch}(\\ell) \\cup \\text{Tree}\\!\\left(n{-}1,\\, r\\ell,\\, \\theta - \\alpha\\right) \\cup \\text{Tree}\\!\\left(n{-}1,\\, r\\ell,\\, \\theta + \\alpha\\right)$$\n\nwhere $r \\in (0, 1)$ is the **length ratio**, $\\alpha$ is the **branch angle**, and recursion bottoms out at $n = 0$ or $\\ell < 1$.\n\n## Connection to L-Systems\n\nFractal trees are the canonical example of an **L-system** (Lindenmayer system). The grammar\n\n$$F \\to F[{+}F][{-}F]$$\n\nproduces exactly this branching pattern when turtle-interpreted: move forward, save state, turn left and recurse, restore state, turn right and recurse.\n\n## This Notebook\n\nUse the sliders in the next cell to sculpt your tree in real time. Adjust the branch angle, recursion depth, length ratio, and even apply a *wind* offset to lean the canopy.",
      "cargo_toml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_1",
      "order": 1,
      "label": "Tree Controls",
      "cell_type": "Code",
      "collapsed": true,
      "source": "(\n    ui::slider(\"angle\", 10.0, 80.0)\n        .step(0.5)\n        .label(\"Branch Angle (°)\")\n        .default_value(30.0),\n    ui::slider(\"depth\", 2.0, 12.0)\n        .step(1.0)\n        .label(\"Recursion Depth\")\n        .default_value(9.0),\n    ui::slider(\"ratio\", 0.50, 0.85)\n        .step(0.01)\n        .label(\"Length Ratio\")\n        .default_value(0.70),\n    ui::slider(\"wind\", -15.0, 15.0)\n        .step(0.5)\n        .label(\"Wind\")\n        .default_value(0.0),\n)\n",
      "cargo_toml": null,
      "saved_output": "[{\"Interactive\":{\"kind\":\"slider\",\"config\":\"{\\\"default\\\":30.0,\\\"label\\\":\\\"Branch Angle (°)\\\",\\\"max\\\":80.0,\\\"min\\\":10.0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"angle\\\",\\\"step\\\":0.5}\"}},{\"Interactive\":{\"kind\":\"slider\",\"config\":\"{\\\"default\\\":9.0,\\\"label\\\":\\\"Recursion Depth\\\",\\\"max\\\":12.0,\\\"min\\\":2.0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"depth\\\",\\\"step\\\":1.0}\"}},{\"Interactive\":{\"kind\":\"slider\",\"config\":\"{\\\"default\\\":0.7,\\\"label\\\":\\\"Length Ratio\\\",\\\"max\\\":0.85,\\\"min\\\":0.5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"ratio\\\",\\\"step\\\":0.01}\"}},{\"Interactive\":{\"kind\":\"slider\",\"config\":\"{\\\"default\\\":0.0,\\\"label\\\":\\\"Wind\\\",\\\"max\\\":15.0,\\\"min\\\":-15.0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"wind\\\",\\\"step\\\":0.5}\"}}]"
    },
    {
      "id": "cell_2",
      "order": 2,
      "label": "Fractal Tree",
      "cell_type": "Code",
      "collapsed": true,
      "source": "use ironpad_cell::prelude::*;\n\n// ── Helpers ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nfn lerp(a: f64, b: f64, t: f64) -> f64 {\n    a + (b - a) * t\n}\n\n/// Recursively emit SVG `<line>` (and leaf `<circle>`) elements into `buf`.\n///\n/// - `(x, y)` — start point of this branch\n/// - `len`    — length of this branch in pixels\n/// - `angle_deg` — direction the branch points (−90 = straight up)\n/// - `remaining` — recursion levels left\n/// - `max_depth` — original full depth (used for color interpolation)\nfn draw_branch(\n    buf: &mut String,\n    x: f64,\n    y: f64,\n    len: f64,\n    angle_deg: f64,\n    remaining: u32,\n    branch_angle: f64,\n    ratio: f64,\n    wind: f64,\n    max_depth: u32,\n) {\n    if remaining == 0 || len < 1.0 {\n        return;\n    }\n\n    let rad = angle_deg.to_radians();\n    let x2 = x + len * rad.cos();\n    let y2 = y + len * rad.sin();\n\n    // Color: interpolate brown (#8B4513) → green (#228B22) as depth decreases.\n    let t = 1.0 - (remaining as f64 / max_depth as f64);\n    let r = lerp(139.0, 34.0, t) as u8;\n    let g = lerp(69.0, 139.0, t) as u8;\n    let b = lerp(19.0, 34.0, t) as u8;\n\n    // Stroke width tapers with depth.\n    let thickness = (remaining as f64 * 1.5).max(1.0);\n\n    buf.push_str(&format!(\n        r#\"<line x1=\"{x:.1}\" y1=\"{y:.1}\" x2=\"{x2:.1}\" y2=\"{y2:.1}\" stroke=\"rgb({r},{g},{b})\" stroke-width=\"{thickness:.1}\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\"#\n    ));\n\n    // Wind effect grows stronger toward the tips (more depth consumed).\n    let wind_offset = wind * (max_depth - remaining) as f64 * 0.1;\n\n    let new_len = len * ratio;\n    draw_branch(buf, x2, y2, new_len, angle_deg - branch_angle + wind_offset, remaining - 1, branch_angle, ratio, wind, max_depth);\n    draw_branch(buf, x2, y2, new_len, angle_deg + branch_angle + wind_offset, remaining - 1, branch_angle, ratio, wind, max_depth);\n\n    // Leaves at terminal branches.\n    if remaining == 1 {\n        buf.push_str(&format!(\n            r##\"<circle cx=\"{x2:.1}\" cy=\"{y2:.1}\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#44cc44\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\"##\n        ));\n    }\n}\n\n// ── Star field ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n/// Generate a deterministic field of tiny stars using a simple LCG.\nfn star_field() -> String {\n    let mut buf = String::new();\n    let mut state: u64 = 0xdeadbeef_cafebabe;\n    for _ in 0..120 {\n        state = state.wrapping_mul(6364136223846793005).wrapping_add(1442695040888963407);\n        let x = (state >> 33) % 800;\n        state = state.wrapping_mul(6364136223846793005).wrapping_add(1442695040888963407);\n        let y = (state >> 33) % 400; // only upper portion — sky\n        state = state.wrapping_mul(6364136223846793005).wrapping_add(1442695040888963407);\n        let r_frac = ((state >> 48) as f64) / 65535.0;\n        let radius = 0.4 + r_frac * 1.1;\n        let opacity = 0.4 + r_frac * 0.6;\n        buf.push_str(&format!(\n            r#\"<circle cx=\"{x}\" cy=\"{y}\" r=\"{radius:.2}\" fill=\"white\" opacity=\"{opacity:.2}\"/>\"#\n        ));\n    }\n    buf\n}\n\n// ── LiveView ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nstruct FractalTree;\n\nimpl LiveView for FractalTree {\n    fn init() -> Self {\n        Self\n    }\n\n    fn tick(&mut self) -> LiveContent {\n        let angle = sim::read::<f64>(\"angle\").unwrap_or(30.0);\n        let depth = sim::read::<f64>(\"depth\").unwrap_or(9.0) as u32;\n        let ratio = sim::read::<f64>(\"ratio\").unwrap_or(0.70);\n        let wind  = sim::read::<f64>(\"wind\").unwrap_or(0.0);\n\n        let stars = star_field();\n\n        let mut lines = String::new();\n        // Trunk base: bottom-center of the 800×600 viewport, pointing straight up.\n        draw_branch(&mut lines, 400.0, 580.0, 130.0, -90.0_f64, depth, angle, ratio, wind, depth);\n\n        let svg = format!(\n            r##\"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 600\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:800px;background:linear-gradient(to top, #0a0a1a 0%, #0d1b3e 60%, #1a1a3e 100%);border-radius:8px;display:block;\">\n  <defs>\n    <radialGradient id=\"moonGlow\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"50%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#ffffee\" stop-opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ffffee\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n    </radialGradient>\n  </defs>\n  {stars}\n  <circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"70\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#fffff0\" opacity=\"0.92\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"70\" r=\"46\" fill=\"url(#moonGlow)\"/>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"560\" width=\"800\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#0a1a0a\" rx=\"0\"/>\n  {lines}\n</svg>\"##\n        );\n\n        LiveContent::Html(svg)\n    }\n\n    fn fps() -> u32 {\n        15\n    }\n}\n",
      "cargo_toml": null,
      "saved_output": "[{\"LiveView\":{\"fps\":15,\"kind\":\"html\",\"content\":\"<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 600\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;max-width:800px;background:linear-gradient(to top, #0a0a1a 0%, #0d1b3e 60%, #1a1a3e 100%);border-radius:8px;display:block;\\\">\\n  <defs>\\n    <radialGradient id=\\\"moonGlow\\\" cx=\\\"50%\\\" cy=\\\"50%\\\" r=\\\"50%\\\">\\n      <stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffffee\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n      <stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffffee\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0\\\"/>\\n    </radialGradient>\\n  </defs>\\n  <circle cx=\\\"313\\\" cy=\\\"16\\\" r=\\\"0.69\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.56\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"308\\\" cy=\\\"3\\\" r=\\\"1.41\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.95\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"786\\\" cy=\\\"191\\\" r=\\\"0.54\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.48\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"558\\\" cy=\\\"329\\\" r=\\\"0.82\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.63\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"297\\\" cy=\\\"317\\\" r=\\\"0.52\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.47\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"422\\\" cy=\\\"289\\\" r=\\\"0.43\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.42\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"265\\\" cy=\\\"67\\\" r=\\\"1.31\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.89\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"660\\\" cy=\\\"283\\\" r=\\\"0.66\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.54\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"491\\\" cy=\\\"343\\\" r=\\\"0.97\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.71\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"460\\\" cy=\\\"83\\\" r=\\\"0.79\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.62\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"45\\\" cy=\\\"144\\\" r=\\\"0.84\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.64\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"262\\\" cy=\\\"362\\\" r=\\\"0.99\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.72\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"607\\\" cy=\\\"278\\\" r=\\\"1.28\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.88\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"336\\\" cy=\\\"127\\\" r=\\\"1.25\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.86\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"170\\\" cy=\\\"58\\\" r=\\\"0.78\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.61\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"719\\\" cy=\\\"313\\\" r=\\\"1.42\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.96\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"88\\\" cy=\\\"1\\\" r=\\\"1.45\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.97\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"131\\\" cy=\\\"376\\\" r=\\\"1.09\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.78\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"776\\\" cy=\\\"264\\\" r=\\\"1.17\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.82\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"519\\\" cy=\\\"54\\\" r=\\\"1.03\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.74\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"424\\\" cy=\\\"348\\\" r=\\\"0.88\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.66\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"707\\\" cy=\\\"392\\\" r=\\\"1.02\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.74\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"466\\\" cy=\\\"95\\\" r=\\\"0.74\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.58\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"352\\\" cy=\\\"66\\\" r=\\\"0.68\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.55\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"580\\\" cy=\\\"239\\\" r=\\\"1.03\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.74\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"119\\\" cy=\\\"55\\\" r=\\\"0.92\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.69\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"81\\\" cy=\\\"202\\\" r=\\\"0.71\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.57\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"356\\\" cy=\\\"211\\\" r=\\\"1.16\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.82\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"7\\\" cy=\\\"16\\\" r=\\\"0.97\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.71\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"2\\\" r=\\\"0.58\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.50\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"674\\\" cy=\\\"360\\\" r=\\\"0.76\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.60\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"136\\\" cy=\\\"71\\\" r=\\\"1.38\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.93\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"553\\\" cy=\\\"89\\\" r=\\\"1.05\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.76\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"763\\\" cy=\\\"14\\\" r=\\\"1.08\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.77\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"44\\\" cy=\\\"255\\\" r=\\\"0.45\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.43\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"147\\\" cy=\\\"51\\\" r=\\\"0.73\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.58\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"295\\\" cy=\\\"3\\\" r=\\\"0.89\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.67\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"242\\\" cy=\\\"73\\\" r=\\\"1.24\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.86\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"272\\\" cy=\\\"289\\\" r=\\\"1.30\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.89\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"385\\\" cy=\\\"308\\\" r=\\\"0.73\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.58\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"674\\\" cy=\\\"99\\\" r=\\\"0.90\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.67\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"194\\\" cy=\\\"375\\\" r=\\\"0.58\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.50\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"676\\\" cy=\\\"22\\\" r=\\\"1.31\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.90\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"30\\\" cy=\\\"333\\\" r=\\\"0.51\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.46\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"366\\\" cy=\\\"364\\\" r=\\\"0.95\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.70\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"564\\\" cy=\\\"159\\\" r=\\\"0.85\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.64\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"787\\\" cy=\\\"275\\\" r=\\\"0.98\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.72\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"28\\\" cy=\\\"192\\\" r=\\\"1.26\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.87\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"759\\\" cy=\\\"67\\\" r=\\\"1.13\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.80\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"6\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1.06\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.76\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"438\\\" cy=\\\"393\\\" r=\\\"1.11\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.79\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"466\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" r=\\\"0.61\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.51\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"34\\\" cy=\\\"387\\\" r=\\\"1.04\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.75\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"795\\\" cy=\\\"140\\\" r=\\\"1.05\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.76\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"371\\\" cy=\\\"343\\\" r=\\\"0.45\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.43\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"504\\\" cy=\\\"318\\\" r=\\\"1.16\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.81\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"140\\\" cy=\\\"277\\\" r=\\\"0.56\\\" fill=\\\"white\\\" opacity=\\\"0.49\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"651\\\" cy=\\\"36\\\" r=\\\"0.80\\\" fill=\\\"whit